			"Message": "chore(build): update Zod dependency to 3.25.31\n\n- Resolves merge conflict in package.json by accepting updated Zod version\n- Updates schema validation library to latest patch version (3.25.30 → 3.25.31)\n- Maintains compatibility with Land's IPC validation requirements in Vine layer\n- Ensures type-safe RPC communication between Mountain backend and Cocoon extension host\n- Includes automatic timestamp update in .github/Update.md as part of standard CI process\n\nThis routine dependency update helps ensure validation reliability for:\n- RPC message structures defined in Echo contracts\n- Configuration schema validation during Mountain bootstrap\n- Extension host protocol compliance checks in Cocoon shim layer",
