			"Message": "feat(Shim): Enhance Electron API shims for Tauri bridge\n\n- Overhaul IPC shim implementation to better mimic Electron's ipcRenderer using Tauri's invoke/listen mechanisms\n- Add detailed type definitions aligning with VS Code's sandbox globals interface (IMainWindowSandboxGlobals)\n- Implement process shim with accurate platform/arch detection and environment handling via Mountain backend\n- Improve configuration resolution flow with proper error handling and UI feedback\n- Add WebFrame shim for zoom level management and WebUtils shim for file path handling\n- Implement memory info reporting and process event handling for uncaught exceptions\n- Add MessagePort acquisition stub with warnings for unsupported features\n\nThese changes enable VS Code's workbench UI to initialize correctly in the Tauri webview environment by providing faithful Electron API emulation, critical for the Land project's Electron-to-Tauri migration path. The enhanced shim layer supports core VS Code functionality while maintaining security through channel validation.",
