			"Message": "perf(Sky): optimize script loading and prefetch behavior\n\n- Added `defer` attribute to all workbench-related script tags in Application.astro to enable parallel downloading without blocking DOM parsing\n- Disabled Astro prefetch functionality in astro.config.ts to prevent aggressive link prefetching in editor environment\n- Changes improve initial load performance by allowing non-critical scripts (CSS loader, extension registration) to load asynchronously\n- Prefetch disable reduces unnecessary network requests during application bootstrap phase\n- Aligns with Land's performance optimization goals by minimizing main thread contention during critical workbench initialization",
			"SHA": "afabe6a963e23f784fd356b619e3e84ba11f7438"
		},
