			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add internationalization support and keyboard layout configurations\n\n- Imported VSCode's nls.messages.js in Browser.astro to enable localization infrastructure\n- Removed 'defer' attributes from script tags in Application.astro to ensure proper loading order\n- Added Windows keyboard layout configurations for 20+ languages under vs/workbench/services/keybinding\n- Updated astro.config.ts to use Node.js protocol imports for better ES module compatibility\n- Restructured workbench.js loading to include nls messages as prerequisite dependency\n\nThese changes establish the foundation for multilingual support in Land's UI layer (Sky) and ensure proper keyboard mapping handling across different locales, maintaining compatibility with VSCode's input handling standards. The keyboard layout implementations are critical for maintaining expected editor behavior when running extensions through the Cocoon shim layer.\n\nRefs #123",
